---
title: "Broadsheet 1915 · The Shell Scandal — Theme Thunder"
---
{%- set art = collections.articles | articleBySlug("shell-scandal-1915") -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }} — {{ site.name }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ art.data.dek }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.name }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ art.data.title }} — Theme Thunder edition">
<meta property="og:description" content="Theme Thunder: the shell scandal told as a 1915 London broadsheet — blackletter nameplate, column rules, price one penny.">
<meta property="og:type" content="article">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Crect width='16' height='16' fill='%23f1e6cd'/%3E%3Ctext x='8' y='12' font-family='serif' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23241f16'%3E%C2%A7%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Old+Standard+TT:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=UnifrakturCook:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============================================================
   THEME THUNDER № 6 — "BROADSHEET 1915"
   A London front page of Friday, 21 May 1915: blackletter
   nameplate, stacked decks, column rules, price one penny.
   ============================================================ */
:root {
  --paper: #f1e6cd;
  --ink:   #241f16;
  --ink-2: #57492f;
  --rule:  #241f16;
  --faint: rgba(36, 31, 22, 0.35);
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 30rem 20rem at 92% 4%, rgba(150, 110, 50, 0.10), transparent 65%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 24rem 18rem at 6% 96%, rgba(150, 110, 50, 0.12), transparent 65%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 100% at 50% 40%, var(--paper) 60%, #e3d3ab 100%);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: "Old Standard TT", "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.52;
}
a { color: inherit; }
a:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); text-decoration: none; }
::selection { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
.broadsheet { max-width: 68rem; margin-inline: auto; padding: 0 1.4rem 3rem; }

/* --- discreet modern strip --------------------------------- */
.modernstrip {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.3rem 1.4rem;
  font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-2);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); padding: 0.5rem 0 0.4rem;
}
.modernstrip a { font-weight: 700; }

/* --- nameplate --------------------------------------------- */
.plate { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.6rem 0 0.9rem; }
.platebox { border: 1.5px solid var(--rule); padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem; font-size: 0.72rem; line-height: 1.35; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 11rem; }
.platebox.r { justify-self: end; }
.nameplate {
  font-family: "UnifrakturCook", "Old Standard TT", serif; font-weight: 700;
  font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7.5vw, 4.4rem); line-height: 1; text-align: center; margin: 0;
}
@media (max-width: 46rem) { .plate { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .platebox { display: none; } }
.datebar {
  border-top: 2.5px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 2.5px solid var(--rule);
  box-shadow: 0 3.5px 0 -2px var(--rule), 0 -3.5px 0 -2px var(--rule);
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.2rem 1.6rem;
  padding: 0.32rem 0.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.86rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* --- page grid --------------------------------------------- */
.pagegrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0 1.6rem; }
.maincol { padding-right: 1.6rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--faint); }
.sidecol { font-size: 0.94rem; }
@media (max-width: 52rem) {
  .pagegrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .maincol { padding-right: 0; border-right: 0; }
  .sidecol { border-top: 2.5px solid var(--rule); margin-top: 2.4rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; }
}

/* --- decks ------------------------------------------------- */
.decks { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
.deck1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.6vw, 2.7rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1.12; margin: 0 0 0.55rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
.deck { font-size: 1.18rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.55rem 0; }
.deck-sm { font-size: 0.92rem; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin: 0.55rem 0 0; }
.deckrule { width: 5.5rem; height: 1px; background: var(--rule); border: 0; margin: 0.55rem auto; }
.deckrule--heavy { height: 3px; }
.standfirst { font-style: italic; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.5; border-block: 1px solid var(--faint); padding: 0.7rem 0.2rem; margin: 0 0 1.4rem; }

/* --- article text ------------------------------------------ */
.report > p { margin: 0 0 0.95em; text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; }
.report > p:first-of-type::first-letter {
  float: left; font-size: 3.3em; line-height: 0.82; font-weight: 700;
  padding: 0.04em 0.12em 0 0;
}
.report h2 {
  font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: center; margin: 1.9em 0 1em;
}
.report h2::before { content: "❦"; display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
.report em { font-style: italic; }
/* factbox → ruled figures box */
.report .factbox { border: 2.5px solid var(--rule); outline: 1px solid var(--rule); outline-offset: 2px; padding: 0.85rem 1rem 0.7rem; margin: 1.7em 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }
.report .factbox-title { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); padding-bottom: 0.45rem; }
.report .factbox dl { margin: 0; }
.report .factbox .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.3rem; padding: 0.34rem 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--faint); }
.report .factbox .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.report .factbox dt { font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-2); }
.report .factbox dd { margin: 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; }
/* pullquote → the dispatch extract */
.report .pullquote { margin: 1.9em 1.4rem; text-align: center; }
.report .pullquote::before { content: "THE DISPATCH VERBATIM."; display: block; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
.report .pullquote p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.28rem; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic; }
.report .pullquote p::before { content: "“"; }
.report .pullquote p::after { content: "”"; }
.report .pullquote cite { display: block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-style: normal; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.14em; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.report .pullquote cite::before { content: "— "; }
.report .dinkus { text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1em; padding-left: 1em; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 1.6em 0; }

/* --- side column ------------------------------------------- */
.sidehead {
  font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: center; border-top: 2.5px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding: 0.4rem 0 0.35rem; margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
}
.sidecol section + section .sidehead { margin-top: 2rem; }
.tele { margin: 0 0 0.9em; text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; }
.tele .dl { font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 700; }
.tele-rule { width: 3.5rem; height: 1px; background: var(--faint); border: 0; margin: 0.9rem auto; }
/* course of the crisis */
.crisis { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.crisis li { padding: 0.55rem 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--faint); }
.crisis li.key { background: rgba(36, 31, 22, 0.05); outline: 1px solid var(--faint); padding-inline: 0.6rem; }
.crisis .d { font-variant: small-caps; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; display: block; }
.crisis h3 { display: inline; font-size: 0.97rem; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; margin: 0; }
.crisis p { display: inline; margin: 0; }
.crisis h3::after { content: " — "; font-weight: 400; }
/* adverts */
.advert { border: 2.5px solid var(--rule); padding: 0.9rem 0.8rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
.advert .ad1 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; }
.advert .ad2 { font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 0.45rem; }
.advert .ad3 { font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); }

/* --- sources + imprint ------------------------------------- */
.sources1915 { margin-top: 2.6rem; border-top: 2.5px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.sources1915 h2 { font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
.sources1915 ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; column-gap: 2.4rem; }
@media (min-width: 52rem) { .sources1915 ol { columns: 2; } }
.sources1915 li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; break-inside: avoid; }
.imprint {
  margin-top: 2.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 0.7rem;
  text-align: center; font-size: 0.82rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-2);
}
.imprint ul { list-style: none; margin: 0.6rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem 2rem; font-style: normal; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.14em; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.imprint a { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="broadsheet">

  <div class="modernstrip">
    <span>{{ site.name }} // Theme Thunder № 6</span>
    <a href="{{ art.url }}">Standard edition →</a>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="plate">
      <div class="platebox">Latest war news.<br>Special edition.</div>
      <h1 class="nameplate">The Daily Sitrep.</h1>
      <div class="platebox r">Registered at the G.P.O.<br>as a newspaper.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="datebar">
      <span>No. 1,915.</span>
      <span>London, Friday, May 21, 1915.</span>
      <span>Price One Penny.</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="pagegrid">
    <div class="maincol">
      <div class="decks">
        <p class="deck1">The Shells Scandal.</p>
        <hr class="deckrule deckrule--heavy">
        <p class="deck">Need of High Explosive.</p>
        <hr class="deckrule">
        <p class="deck">A Government Shaken.</p>
        <hr class="deckrule">
        <p class="deck-sm">(From Our Military Correspondent.)</p>
      </div>

      <p class="standfirst">{{ art.data.dek }}</p>

      <article class="report" aria-label="Article, broadsheet edition">
{{ art.templateContent | safe }}
      </article>

      {%- if art.data.sources %}
      <section class="sources1915" aria-label="Sources">
        <h2>Authorities Consulted.</h2>
        <ol>
          {%- for s in art.data.sources %}
          <li>{{ s | safe }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
      </section>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>

    <aside class="sidecol">
      <section aria-label="Telegrams in brief, period pastiche">
        <h2 class="sidehead">Telegrams in Brief.</h2>
        <p class="tele"><span class="dl">Milan, Thursday.</span> — All Italy stands at the edge of the great quarrel; the Chamber has voted full powers to the Government, and the declaration against Austria is hourly expected.</p>
        <hr class="tele-rule">
        <p class="tele"><span class="dl">Queenstown, Wednesday.</span> — Further depositions have been taken from survivors of the <em>Lusitania</em>, sunk by a German submarine off the Old Head of Kinsale with the loss of nearly 1,200 souls.</p>
        <hr class="tele-rule">
        <p class="tele"><span class="dl">North of Ypres.</span> — The enemy has again employed his asphyxiating gas upon the Flanders front; our troops, now provided with respirators of an improved pattern, held their line.</p>
        <hr class="tele-rule">
        <p class="tele"><span class="dl">The Dardanelles.</span> — The Allied forces ashore on the Gallipoli peninsula report steady progress against entrenched opposition; the fleet's guns co-operate from both straits.</p>
      </section>

      {%- if art.data.timeline %}
      <section aria-label="Course of the crisis">
        <h2 class="sidehead">Course of the Crisis.</h2>
        <ol class="crisis">
          {%- for item in art.data.timeline.items %}
          <li{% if item.key %} class="key"{% endif %}>
            <span class="d">{{ item.date }}.</span>
            <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ item.text }}</p>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
      </section>
      {%- endif %}

      <section aria-label="Advertisements, period pastiche">
        <h2 class="sidehead">Advertisements.</h2>
        <div class="advert">
          <p class="ad1">Welbeck's Waterproofs</p>
          <p class="ad2">Proof against wind and wet — as supplied to officers at the Front.</p>
          <p class="ad3">Illustrated list post free.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="advert">
          <p class="ad1">Steel Tonic Pastilles</p>
          <p class="ad2">For nerve &amp; vigour in trying times. A boon to the munition worker.</p>
          <p class="ad3">Of all chemists · 1s. 1½d.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <footer class="imprint">
    <p>Printed and published as a Theme Thunder edition — the standard {{ site.name }} article of {{ art.date | readableDate }}, unaltered, set as a front page of 1915. Telegrams and advertisements are period pastiche.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="{{ art.url }}">Standard edition</a></li>
      <li><a href="/thunder/">Theme Thunder index</a></li>
      <li><a href="/">{{ site.name }} front page</a></li>
    </ul>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
